      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Most views also read Status.State to show messages and report view-owned errors;\nthose arrows are omitted. Commands reach every service API through its Access\nprotocol. Command-only services have no State, and views never observe them.",
